    <node id="Scheme::Special capital subsidy for thrust sector enterprises">
      <data key="d0">Scheme</data>
      <data key="d1">Special capital subsidy for thrust sector enterprises</data>
      <data key="d2">https://www.tn.gov.in/scheme_details.php?id=MTQ=</data>
      <data key="d3">15% of Plant and Machinery value</data>
      <data key="d4">For 13 identified thrust sectors viz:-
1.Electrical and Electronics Industry
2. Leather and Leather goods.
3.Auto parts and components
4.Drugs and Pharmaceuticals
5. Solar Energy Equipment
6.Gold and Diamond Jewellery for exports
7. Pollution Control Equipments.
8. Sports Goods and Accessories.
9. Cost effective building material.
10. Readymade Garments.
